---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT x.a FROM (SELECT a FROM t LIMIT 1) x LEFT JOIN u ON x.a = u.a LIMIT 2
---
Project [a#0]
+- Limit 2
   +- Join LeftOuter, (a#0 == a#3)
      :- Limit 1
      :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
